<title>USA: FGIC says Ebrahim joins public finance team.</title>
<headline>FGIC says Ebrahim joins public finance team.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said Monday Linda Ebrahim joined the company as a credit analyst in public finance.</p>
<p>Prior to joining FGIC, Ebrahim was an assistant vice president for Moody's Investors Service, working on Southwest regional ratings.</p>
<p>FGIC is a unit of GE Capital Services, a wholly owned subsidiary of General Electric Co.</p>
<p>--Steven Dickson, 212-859-1652</p>
